  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ignite Holding Company Inc (&#x201c;Kingo Energy&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Company&#x201d;) is a prepaid distributed renewable energy provider to off-grid consumers in Latin America. Currently, the Company has 57,000 clients in Guatemala and Colombia and plans to expand its operation reaching 330,000 customers by year 2022. The Company&#x2019;s global plan is to reach 1,000,000 customers by 2030 across 5 different markets.The Company is structuring a private placement of its Series C convertible preferred shares for the expansion of the Company&#x2019;s integrated energy distribution business, IDB Invest is considering a participation in the transaction in an amount of approximately five million United States dollars (US$ 5,000,000) with the participation of the Clean Technology Fund (&#x201c;CTF&#x201d;).</narrative>
  </description>
